Step 1 — Initialize with uv

Your terminal is already here:
PS C:\Users\Hp\python_fast_api\movie_backend>

Run:
uv init

Then:
uv add "fastapi[standard]" sqlalchemy alembic "python-jose[cryptography]" argon2-cffi pydantic-settings psycopg[binary]

========================================================================================================================

Step 2: Create main.py

Inside:
src/movie_backend/

create:
main.py


src/
└── movie_backend/
    └── main.py

Put:
from fastapi import FastAPI

app = FastAPI(
    title="Movie Backend API",
    description="Industry-style Movie Management REST API",
    version="1.0.0",
)


@app.get("/health")
def health_check():
    return {
        "status": "UP",
        "service": "movie-backend",
    }

This gives us the foundation.

==================================================================================================================================

Step 3 Run the application

From:
PS C:\Users\Hp\python_fast_api\movie_backend>

run:
uv run uvicorn movie_backend.main:app --reload

The important part is: movie_backend.main:app because our structure is:

src/
└── movie_backend/
    └── main.py

and inside main.py

